{"id":156,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This creature's fur is most mysterious—it is wholly impervious to the burning touch of flame. Should Quilava turn its back to you, take heed! Such a posture indicates a forthcoming attack."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Quilava keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This Pokémon applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back."},{"games":["X","Crystal"],"text":"Before battle, it turns its back on its opponent to demonstrate how ferociously its fire blazes."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"This Pokémon is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It intimidates foes with intense gusts of flames and superheated air. Its quick nimbleness lets it dodge attacks even while scorching an enemy."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Flash Fire","hidden":true,"description":"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pokémon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":155,"name":"Cyndaquil","condition":null,"children":[{"id":156,"name":"Quilava","condition":"Lv. 14 or Lv. 17, in Hisui","children":[{"id":157,"name":"Typhlosion","condition":"Lv. 36 or Lv. 36, in Hisui","children":[]}]}]},